# --- Repo-local additions (mission "REMOVE THE HUMAN FROM BEAM
# OPERATIONS", packaging follow-up, 2026-09-01) ---
# `beam deploy` was collecting 2.64 GB per deploy despite the patterns
# above, because none of them cover this repo's OWN large directories -
# `.venv`/`.git`/`node_modules` were already excluded but were NOT the
# real offenders here (confirmed via `du -sh`): `.router/` (Router/Remote
# Work worktree infrastructure, 2.1-3.5 GB depending on active worktrees)
# and `.claude/worktrees/` (381 MB) dominated the payload, with
# `web/node_modules` (749 MB, already covered by `**/node_modules/` above)
# and `web/public` (48 MB) contributing the rest.
#
# Confirmed SAFE to exclude everything below: grepped BOTH deployed apps'
# imports (beam_apps/translation_hymt2_app.py imports only `beam.
# integrations`; beam_apps/cover_illustrious_app.py imports only `beam`
# and its own sibling `cover_illustrious_logic` - both entirely within
# `beam_apps/`) - NEITHER app has a single import reaching outside
# `beam_apps/`, so nothing else in this repo is needed at Beam runtime.
# `beam_apps/` itself (and everything actually imported by it) is
# deliberately NOT listed here.
.router
.claude/worktrees
web
server
scripts
desktop_app
capcut_tts_api
tests
docs
deploy
examples
assets
.github
beam_apps/tests
legacy_gradio_app.py
Voice.json
installer.iss
build_app.bat
run_app.bat
run_gradio.bat
README.md
README_GUI.md
requirements-gui.txt
device.json.example
app.py
cli.py
pyproject.toml

# --- Dau ra dong goi desktop (2026-09-13) ---
# `check-payload-size` bat mot REGRESSION that: payload 903.8 MB / 2118 tep,
# ap dao boi `build/` + `dist/` — dau ra PyInstaller cua ung dung DESKTOP
# Router Control Center (cac ban 2026-09-09..10). Dung ho hang voi su co
# 2.64 GB o tren: mot thu muc lon CUA CHINH KHO nay chua duoc phu.
#
# An toan, kiem chung doc lap chu khong chi doc lai chu thich o tren:
#   * `git ls-files` khop `build/` hoac `dist/` o MOI cap = 0 tep — khong
#     mot tep nao duoc theo doi nam trong do;
#   * `beam_apps/` khong mot lan nao nhac toi `build/` hay `dist/`;
#   * moi import cua hai app duoc deploy deu la stdlib, goi cai trong Beam
#     Image (beam/torch/diffusers/transformers/PIL), hoac anh em NGAY TRONG
#     `beam_apps/` (`cover_illustrious_logic`) — khong import nao ra ngoai.
#
# Chung cung la dau ra dong goi cua mot SAN PHAM KHAC (desktop EXE, dung
# Inno Setup), khong phai artifact runtime cua Beam, nen loai tru chung
# khong the giau mat mot artifact phat hanh nao.
#
# TAP TOI THIEU = DUNG TAP MA KHO NAY DA COI LA DAU RA BUILD. `.gitignore`
# muc "Build / dong goi" liet ke `build/`, `dist/`, `dist-v04/`, `dist-*/`,
# `installer_output/`. Chi chep `build/` + `dist/` thi payload xuong 436.4 MB
# — LOT nguong 500 MB nhung con ~430 MB dau ra desktop, va bay BAY con dir
# `dist-v04..dist-v0613` van duoc tai len moi lan deploy (`dist/` kieu
# gitignore KHONG khop `dist-v061`). Mot ban dung nua la do lai.
#
# Dung dang co gach cheo cuoi giong `.gitignore` (dong 48-55) — cung mot
# phuong ngu pathspec, nen giu cung cach viet.
build/
dist/
dist-*/
installer_output/
raw_spool/
logs/
scratch/
earth_3d_simulation/
*.vtt
*.srt
*.png
*.jpg
*.mp4
*.mp3
